# Haruspex security decision seed — OFFENSIVE (pentest/red-team) + DEFENSIVE (SOC/blue-team).
# The security specialization: decisions a security operator/agent makes repeatedly.
# Mix this with general decision data (mmdm) so the model keeps broad competence.
# --- OFFENSIVE: template/probe relevance ---
